3. Adafruit_ILI9341 panel init sequence  (BSD-3-Clause)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Source:     Adafruit_ILI9341.cpp initcmd[]
  Copyright:  (c) 2013 Adafruit Industries. All rights reserved.
  License:    BSD-3-Clause
  Upstream:   https://github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_ILI9341

  Used by:    packages/framework-esp32/src/displays/ili9341-esp32.ts
                (the ILI9341 init command table)

  Scope:      The manufacturer power-on sequence + power control + gamma +
